>>      smpcfd_prepare_cpu(smp_processor_id());
>>  }
>>
>> +static inline void
>
> Given the use of _RET_IP_, I would strongly recommend you use
> __always_inline.
>

Noted, thanks

>> +send_call_function_ipi_mask(const struct cpumask *mask)
